{"4462210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roshambogg", "steam_appid": 4462210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roshambogg is a 2D side-scrolling rock-paper-scissors fighting game for two players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as tiny hands that platform across multiple arenas, actively switch between rock, paper and scissors to counter your opponent and dash into them to defeat them! <br><br>Instead of throwing hands at the same time, dance around and fake each other out while swapping between states, until you're ready to finally close the distance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from fighting game mechanics and Nidhogg, fights are decided by who out-speeds who, and/or who out-reads who.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the end of the level to win while your opponent fights to go the other way, but any advantage can be clawed out of your hands, as the closest thing to scoring is how much ground you have over your enemy.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roshambogg is a 2D side-scrolling rock-paper-scissors fighting game for two players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as tiny hands that platform across multiple arenas, actively switch between rock, paper and scissors to counter your opponent and dash into them to defeat them! <br><br>Instead of throwing hands at the same time, dance around and fake each other out while swapping between states, until you're ready to finally close the distance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from fighting game mechanics and Nidhogg, fights are decided by who out-speeds who, and/or who out-reads who.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the end of the level to win while your opponent fights to go the other way, but any advantage can be clawed out of your hands, as the closest thing to scoring is how much ground you have over your enemy.</p>", "short_description": "A 2D side-scrolling rock-paper-scissors fighting game", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Wonderful impulsive action”<br />\r\ngiwake<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462210/f53d2e4b39aed54861584cd710bbdab64b22edc3/header.jpg?t=1772186457", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462210/6eeb1b36582fac0d10e4502f8c51f87ad631376d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772186457", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462210/6eeb1b36582fac0d10e4502f8c51f87ad631376d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772186457", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 760 or AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["vnsvd"], "publishers": ["vnsvd"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 37, "description": "Shared/Split Screen PvP"}, {"id": 24, "description": "Shared/Split Screen"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 44, "description": "Remote Play Together"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462210/7bc9736148ecf4bde944a0b59489275fdc71d305/ss_7bc9736148ecf4bde944a0b59489275fdc71d305.600x338.jpg?t=1